# RFC7162 3.2.5: the QRESYNC select parameter is legal only once the
# client has enabled QRESYNC, and using it without is a BAD rather than
# an implicit enable. Enabling it implicitly would let a client that
# forgot work here and then fail against a stricter server.
depends login
send 1
a select inbox (qresync (1 1))
receive 1
a BAD QRESYNC must be enabled before it can be used
end
